# Regenerable artifact cache. Stage 01 onward rebuilds every file here.
# Figures in docs/figures/ ARE tracked, so the thesis can cite them by a stable path.
artifacts/*
# ...except the Y2 regression baseline, which is a HISTORICAL SNAPSHOT of commit 1fbf6275
# and cannot be regenerated from a later state. tests/test_y2_frozen.py compares the live
# pipeline against it; losing it would silently turn 20 freeze assertions into skips.
!artifacts/frozen_baseline.json

# nbconvert stderr logs
notebooks/err_*.txt
notebooks/nb_err.txt
